id": "2584489251769193", "uri": "https://scontent-lhr11-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/75572752_2584489255102526_3807980990328995840_n.png?_nc_cat=100&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=79u04WtnOW4Q7kNvwHVWOMp&_nc_oc=AdpQR4QFY9gxOYvXeamr6qOPpbyyJek7Q9jsXINe7NPZ5QjcS_ueEbhEuNiHogvglSA&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-lhr11-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQEjxAt_YROYxigfCw9iPdI7HpP4ijr_HhtMg9sOs8nhew&oe=6A8EE1E8"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": null, "display_name": "Supernatural", "keywords": ["demo", "sports", "fitness", "rhythm", "free"], "long_description": "Supernatural offers a complete and connected fitness experience in VR. \n\nSubscribe to Supernatural to enjoy fun, rhythm-mapped workouts published every day.\n\nDesigned specifically for fitness, Supernatural brings you: \n* Full body, personalized workouts\n* Expert coaching from real fitness trainers\n* Workouts mapped to music from the world's most popular artists\n* Incredible photoreal landscapes to exercise in\n\nDownload the Supernatural Companion App for your smartphone to start your subscription, follow and compete with friends, and pair an optional heart rate tracker. \n\nWorkout near, go far.", "short_description": "Supernatural offers a complete and connected fitness experience in VR.\n\nSubscribe to Supernatural for fun, rhythm-mapped workouts every day. \n\nDesigned for fitness, Supernatural brings you: \n* Full body, personalized workouts\n* Expert coaching from real trainers\n* Music from top artists\n* Incredible photoreal landscapes\n\nDownload the Supernatural Companion App for your smartphone to start your subscription, connect with friends, and pair an optional heart rate tracker. \n\nWorkout near, go far."}]}, "developer_name": "Within Unlimited, Inc.", "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://www.getsupernatural.com/privacy", "developer_terms_of_service_url": "https://www.getsupernatural.com/terms", "publisher_name": "Within Unlimited, Inc.", "support_website_url": "https://